	(descr "Hamamatsu S1226-5BQ silicon photodiode, TO-5 metal can with quartz window, 2 leads on a 5.08mm pitch, phi 0.45mm leads, phi 9.1mm base flange, phi 8.1mm cap, phi 5.9mm window, 2.4x2.4mm active area (drawn on F.Fab), 4.1mm above the board. Through-hole, 0.7mm drill, origin on pad 1. Pad 1 = cathode = datasheet lead (2), which is also connected to the case; pad 2 = anode = datasheet lead (1). https://www.hamamatsu.com/content/dam/hamamatsu-photonics/sites/documents/99_SALES_LIBRARY/ssd/s1226_series_kspd1034e.pdf")
